  <jpcrp_cor:AnnexedDetailedScheduleOfAssetRetirementObligationsFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;"&gt;【資産除去債務明細表】&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedDetailedScheduleOfAssetRetirementObligationsFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(2) 【主な資産及び負債の内容】&lt;/h4&gt;
